        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2-4 Any cost increase of the insurance package will be considered part of the compensation package negotiated for teachers. The District's Insurance Committee will continue to work on holding down increased costs and examine the market of insurance programs while maintaining current costs or minimize any cost increases. JCEA will discuss any insurance increases with their Board of Directors.",
